Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.41,0:00:36.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美国二十世纪福斯公司出品
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:09.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}李安执导作品
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.49,0:01:21.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}少年派的奇幻漂流
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}苏拉·沙玛 饰派
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伊尔凡 可汗 饰成年派
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:43.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}塔布 饰派母亲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉菲·斯波 饰 作家
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.62,0:01:59.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰拉尔·德帕迪约 饰法国人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:06.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿迪尔 胡山 饰 派父亲 阿尤什·坦东 饰 年轻派
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:19.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}服装设计 阿尔朱 巴辛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:26.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原创音乐 麦切尔·丹纳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.07,0:02:34.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}视觉特效总监 比尔·威斯登霍佛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:51.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}联合制片 大卫·李
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:59.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}剪辑 蒂姆·史奎尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.10,0:03:05.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}美术 戴维·葛罗普曼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.36,0:03:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄影 克劳迪奥·米兰达
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:21.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}执行制片人 迪恩基奥迦里斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:33.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制片人 吉尔·内特 李安戴维·沃马克
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:38.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}根据扬·马特尔同名小说改编
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.47,0:03:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}编剧大卫 马戈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.19,0:03:58.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}导演 李安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.99,0:04:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是在动物园长大的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you were raised in a zoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.74,0:04:02.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出生也在那里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Born and raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.20,0:04:05.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在朋迪榭里 法属印度的一个小镇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In Pondicherry, in what was the French part of India.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:07.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲是动物园园长\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father owned the zoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:11.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一位爬行动物学家临时为我接的生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I was delivered on short notice by a herpetologist...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他当时是去园里看一只孟加拉巨型蜥蜴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who was there to check on the Bengal monitor lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.34,0:04:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们母子平安无事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mother and I were both healthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.59,0:04:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但那只巨型蜥蜴却跑了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but the poor lizard escaped...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:22.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果它被受惊的食火鸡踩扁了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and was trampled by a frightened cassowary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.60,0:04:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是因果报应对吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The way of karma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.35,0:04:29.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天意难违\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The way of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:32.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这故事太精彩了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's quite a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:35.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚听到你的名字 我还以为你父亲是数学家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had assumed your father was a mathematician because of your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:38.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}差得远了 其实我跟个游泳池同名\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Far from it, I was named after a swimming pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有叫派的游泳池吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There is a swimming pool named "Pi"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.07,0:04:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的叔叔弗朗西斯出生的时候 肺里有很多积水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, my uncle Francis was born with too much water in his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听说医生拎起他的脚 把水甩了出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They say the doctors swung Francis around by the ankles to clear the water out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:55.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以他的胸很厚 腿很细\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and that's what gave him the huge chest and skinny legs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.09,0:04:57.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来成了游泳健将\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that made him such a great swimmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.30,0:05:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗朗西斯是你的亲叔叔吗 他自己说是你父亲的朋友啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is Francis actually your uncle? He said he was friends with your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.05,0:05:05.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我干叔 我们印度语叫妈妈纪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's my honorary uncle, I call him Mamaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:07.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是我父亲的至交 我的游泳导师\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father's best friend, my swimming guru.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:11.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每周我跟着他在修道院练习三次游泳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I trained with him three times a week at the ashram.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他的教导后来救了我的命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}His lessons would save my life in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝口水不要紧 惊慌最要命 千万别慌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A mouthful of water will not harm you, but panic will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住要呼吸 不要气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember to breathe now, don't hold your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.99,0:05:26.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.91,0:05:31.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我吃素 你不介意吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope you don't mind vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:34.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 什么都行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你的名字呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.88,0:05:36.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚才你正要说名字的由来 接着说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were going to tell me how you got your name, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.59,0:05:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 这跟妈妈纪跟我爸说的一件事有关\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yes. I got it from something Mamaji once told my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.76,0:05:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一般人旅行都会收集明信片 茶杯什么的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You see, most travelers collect postcards or teacups on their journeys...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.35,0:05:48.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但妈妈纪不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but not Mamaji.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.52,0:05:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他喜欢游泳池\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mamaji collects swimming pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.77,0:05:53.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}见到游泳池就跳进去游\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He swims in every pool he comes upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.60,0:05:57.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便辛·墨利多游泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.70,0:06:05.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一天妈妈纪对我爸说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One day, Mamaji said to my father that, of all the pools in the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.95,0:06:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世界上最美的游泳池是 巴黎的一个公共游泳池\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the most beautiful was a public pool in Paris.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那里的水干净到早上能拿来煮咖啡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That the water there was so clear, you could make your morning coffee with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.16,0:06:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在那里的一游改变了他的一生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That a single swim there changed his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:32.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我出生前 他说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before I was born, he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.31,0:06:34.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是希望你儿子心灵纯净\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"If you want your son to have a clean soul...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.06,0:06:39.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将来一定要带他去 便辛 墨利多游泳池游泳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"you must take him one day to swim in the Piscine Molitor."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:43.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直不懂我爸为什么那么在意这件事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never understood why my father took this so much to heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:49.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他就是在意\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he did, and I was named "Piscine Molitor Patel."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我就成了便辛 墨利多 帕帖尔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.99,0:06:52.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想想这名字说起来多尴尬\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Imagine me trying to explain that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:55.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好不容易撑到11岁之后\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I barely made it to the age of 11 before...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便辛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Piscine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:01.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的小便很腥吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you pissing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.84,0:07:03.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看啊 他在小便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at him, he's pissing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.55,0:07:07.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样 我的名字从优雅高贵的法国泳池\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With one word, my name went from an elegant French swimming pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:09.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}变成了腥恶臭的公共厕所\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to a stinking Indian latrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到处都有人叫我小便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was "Pissing" everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不准在操场小便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No Pissing in the schoolyard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.89,0:07:17.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就连老师也拿我开玩笑\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even the teachers started doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.85,0:07:19.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然不是故意的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not deliberately, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.36,0:07:23.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么要是太快释放出气体会怎么样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, then, what might occur if we release gas too quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pissing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:27.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说小便呀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said "Pissing."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.36,0:07:29.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说小便 小便
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小便
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 安静\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's enough! Order! Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.04,0:07:40.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二年放假回来 开学的第一天 我有备而来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When we returned the next year for our first day of school, I was prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Present, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.04,0:07:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便辛 帕帖尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Piscine Patel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}早上好 我叫便辛 墨利多 帕帖尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good morning. I! am Piscine Molitor Patel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.64,0:07:55.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家都叫我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Known to all as...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:59.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pi, the sixteenth letter of the Greek alphabet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希腊语的第十六个字母
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.90,0:08:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在数学里也被用来表示\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is also used in mathematics to represent the ratio...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.65,0:08:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}圆形的周长与直径的比值\N{\rEN\blur0.8}of any circle's circumference to its diameter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:11.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个无限无理数 通常我们只需要保留两位有效数字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}An irrational number of infinite length, usually rounded to three digits...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:16.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}写成3. 14\N{\rEN\blur0.8}as 3.14.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.08,0:08:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是 J\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.08,0:08:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常好 派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very impressive, Pi. Now, sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:24.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请回到座位上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下一位同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从此你就成了派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And from then on, you were "Pi"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.34,0:08:32.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没那么容易\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, no, not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.93,0:08:35.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}介绍得不错 小便\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice try, Pissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:40.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我还有一整天时间 下一节是法语课\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I still had the whole day ahead of me. French class was next.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:42.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫便辛 墨利多 帕帖尔
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.27,0:08:44.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫我派就行
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:48.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后是地理课\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then, geography.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:52.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是π小数点后的20位有效数字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}These are the first 20 decimal places of pi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.28,0:08:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当天最后一节是数学课\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My last class of the day was mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}慢慢走 别着急\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Slowly, slowly, slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.46,0:08:59.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别着急
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1 2 4
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}3\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three. Seven. Five. Eight. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.79,0:09:06.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}7
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:08.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}5
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.59,0:09:11.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}8 9
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.47,0:09:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}8\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eight. Five. Eight. Nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.05,0:09:16.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}5 8 9
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.31,0:09:19.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错 8 他真的背出来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's right. He's really doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.31,0:09:22.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派 派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pi! Pi! Pi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.90,0:09:27.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那天放学前 我就成了派 帕帖尔 校园传奇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the end of that day, I was Pi Patel, school legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:32.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈纪说你在水手圈也是个传奇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mamaji tells me you're a legend among sailors, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.66,0:09:33.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}独自在海上漂流\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Out there, all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我连船都不会开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even know how to sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:39.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也不是一个人 理查德 帕克跟我一起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I wasn't alone out there. Richard Parker was with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:42.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richard Parker?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈纪没跟我细说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mamaji didn't tell me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:47.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只说我回到蒙特利尔应该联络你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He just said I should look you up when I got back to Montreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:49.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去朋迪榭里干什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what were you doing in Pondicherry?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.42,0:09:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}写一本小说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Writing a novel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:54.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对了 我很喜欢你的第一本书\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the way, I enjoyed your first book.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.22,0:09:57.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}新书的背景是印度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this new one, is it set in India?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:10:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实是葡萄牙 住在印度比较便宜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Portugal, actually. But it's cheaper living in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:05.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}期待能够早日拜读你的新作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I look forward to reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:06.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把它扔了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I threw it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:11.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}花了两年孕育它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Two years trying to bring this thing to life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.03,0:10:14.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一天它却口吐白沫 宣告死亡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then one day, it sputtered, coughed and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:17.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真遗憾\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有天下午我在朋迪榭里泡咖啡馆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was sitting in this coffee house in Pondicherry one afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:25.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哀悼我的损失 郁闷得很\N{\rEN\blur0.8}mourning my loss...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这时隔壁桌一位老人家跟我攀谈起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}when this old man at the table next to me struck up a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:29.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 妈妈纪会那样的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Mamaji, he does that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:31.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈到那部放弃的作品\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When I told him about my abandoned book, he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:36.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说 你一个加拿大人来法属印度找故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"So, a Canadian who's come to French India in search of a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:39.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的朋友 我知道法属加拿大有个印度人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Well, my friend, I Know an Indian in French Canada...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.43,0:10:42.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他有一个最不可思议的故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"with the most incredible story to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.39,0:10:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是命啊 你们两个命中注定是要相遇的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"It must be fate that the two of you should meet."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:53.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我好多年没谈起理查德 帕克了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't spoken about Richard Parker in so many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.28,0:10:55.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈纪都说了什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what has Mamaji already told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:59.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说你有个故事会让我相信上帝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said you had a story that would make me believe in God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:03.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他也会那样说一桌好菜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He would say that about a nice meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:07.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于上帝 我只能说出我的故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As for God, I can only tell you my story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.75,0:11:11.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要相信什么由你决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You will decide for yourself what you believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}合情合理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:16.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想想 该从何说起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's see, then. Where to begin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:21.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋迪榭里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pondicherry is the French Riviera of India.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.18,0:11:21.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是印度的里维耶拉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.35,0:11:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在临海的街道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the streets closest to the ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:30.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会让人误以为置身法国南部\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you might think you were in the south of France.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.98,0:11:35.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}往内陆走几条街有一条运河\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A few blocks inland, there's a canal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.94,0:11:38.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}运河那一头就是印度区\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just beyond that is Indian Pondicherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:42.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穆斯林区则在运河的西边\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the Muslim quarter is just to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.99,0:11:46.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}法国在1954年归还朋迪榭里时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When the French handed Pondicherry back to us in 1954...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.62,0:11:50.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家决定举行一系列活动庆祝一下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the town decided that some sort of commemoration was in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.50,0:11:54.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我父亲很有生意头脑 看到了其中的商机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father, who was a clever businessman, came up with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:57.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原本开旅馆的他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He ran a hotel, and he got the idea to open a Zoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:12:00.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}决定把植物园改建成动物园 大赚一笔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the local botanical gardens instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:02.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.97,0:12:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恰巧我母亲是园里的植物学家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As it also happened, my mother was a botanist in the gardens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是他们相遇 结婚 一年后我哥哥拉维出生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They met, married, and a year later my brother Ravi was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.06,0:12:14.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又过了两年 我也来到人世\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I came two years after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.98,0:12:18.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听起来好神奇 从小在……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It sounds magical, growing up in...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.33,0:12:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来印度教徒也说阿们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know Hindus said "amen."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:31.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天主 印度教徒都会说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Catholic Hindus do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.83,0:12:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天主 印度教徒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Catholic Hindus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:37.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能悔罪的神不只一个 有好几百个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We get to feel guilty before hundreds of gods, instead of just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.05,0:12:40.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你先信印度教\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But you're a Hindu first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.59,0:12:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}认识神明都是由他人带领的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of us knows God until someone introduces us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我先认识的是印度教的神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was first introduced to God as a Hindu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.68,0:12:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}印度教有三千三百万神张\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are 33 million gods in the Hindu religion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怎么可能一个不认识\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How can I not come to know a few of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.27,0:12:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我先认识了黑天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I met Krishna first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.44,0:13:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一次雅修达说小黑天吃士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yashoda once accused baby Krishna of eating dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.03,0:13:05.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真是的 你真皮怎么可以吃土\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Tut, tut you naughty boy - you shouldn't do that."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.49,0:13:08.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是他明明没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.33,0:13:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就告诉妈妈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what he told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有吃士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"I didn't eat dirt."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:16.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雅修达说没有吗 那么……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yashoda said, "No? Well then..."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把嘴巴张开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Open your mouth."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.30,0:13:21.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是黑天张开嘴巴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So Krishna opened his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.14,0:13:24.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道雅修达看见什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what do you think Yashoda saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.22,0:13:25.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.22,0:13:33.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在黑天的嘴里看见了整个宇宙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She saw in Krishna's mouth the whole entire universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.09,0:14:04.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我小时候把众神当作超级英雄\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The gods were my superheroes growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈奴曼 猴神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hanuman, the monkey god...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.76,0:14:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抬起一整座山来拯救朋友罗什曼那\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lifting an entire mountain to save his friend Lakshman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.77,0:14:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}键尼萨 象头神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ganesh, the elephant-headed...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.27,0:14:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赌上性命捍卫母亲雪山女神的名誉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}risking his life to defend the honor of his mother, Parvati.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毗湿奴是三相神之一 万物之源\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vishnu, the supreme soul, the source of all things.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.36,0:14:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在无尽的宇宙之洋漂浮而睡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vishnu sleeps, floating on the shoreless cosmic ocean...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:29.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都来自他的梦境\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we are the stuff of his dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.45,0:14:33.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多壮观啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Spectacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但别让这些故事和光影给骗了 孩子们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't let these stories and pretty lights fool you, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人生不简单\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Religion is darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:48.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的父亲自认是新派印度人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My dear appa believed himself part of the new India.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.68,0:14:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他小时候得过小儿麻痹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As a child, he had had polio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.14,0:14:55.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}倒在床上痛苦不已 纳闷神在哪里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He used to lie in bed racked with pain, wondering where God was.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:15:00.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到头来救他的不是神 而是西方医学\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the end, God didn't save him, Western medicine did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:08.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的母亲念过大学 也认为她的家庭够新派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My amma went to college... and thought her family was part of the new India as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.32,0:15:09.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到姥姥姥爷跟她断绝关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}until her parents cut her off...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.12,0:15:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为他们觉得我父亲配不上我母亲\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because they thought she was marrying beneath her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.66,0:15:17.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}信仰是她与过去唯一的联系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Her religion was the only link she had to her past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.05,0:15:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我12岁时在山上认识了耶稣基督\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I met Christ in the mountains when I was 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去拜访在穆拿种茶的亲戚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were visiting relatives, tea growers in Munnar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.77,0:15:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到那后的第三天 拉维和我都闷坏了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was our third day there. Ravi and I were terribly bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.19,0:15:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打个赌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Challenge. I'll give you two rupees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我赌两个卢比
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.28,0:15:45.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不敢去那间教堂偷圣水喝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Run in to that church and drink the holy water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.61,0:16:26.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一定是渴了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You must be thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:31.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喝吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.62,0:16:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我帮你倒了杯水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I brought you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.59,0:16:51.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那神为什么要这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would a god do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.64,0:16:53.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么要派他的儿子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would He send His own son...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来为凡人的罪恶受难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to suffer for the sins of ordinary people?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.48,0:16:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为神爱世人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because He loves us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.19,0:17:05.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}神让自己能够为人所接近 以便我们了解他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God made Himself approachable to us, human, so we could understand Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们无法完全了解神的完美\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can't understand God in all His perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.53,0:17:13.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们能理解神之子与他的苦难 就像亲兄弟那样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we can understand God's son and His suffering as we would a brother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这话实在说不通\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That made no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}牺牲无辜的人来救赎凡人的罪孽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sacrificing the innocent to atone for the sins of the guilty...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.12,0:17:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这算什么爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What kind of love is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.80,0:17:27.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但上帝之子耶稣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But this son...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.80,0:17:29.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我始终无法理解\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't get him out of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.47,0:17:35.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是神如此完美 而我们不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lf God is so perfect and we are not...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:38.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他为什么要创造万物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why would He want to create all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.85,0:17:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么还需要我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why does He need us at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.39,0:17:44.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只需要知道神爱世人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All you have to know is that He loves us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.98,0:17:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}神因深爱世人而赐予我们他的独子 为我们受难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God so loved this world that He gave His only son.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:50.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听神父讲得越久\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The longer I listened to the priest...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.19,0:17:53.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就越喜欢这位上帝之子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the more I came to like this son of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}毗湿奴 谢谢你介绍基督给我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Vishnu, for introducing me to Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.83,0:18:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我透过印度教认识了信仰 并透过基督找到上帝的爱\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I came to faith through Hinduism and I found God's love through Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:12.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过神对我的旨意尚未完结\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But God wasn't finished with me yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:24.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天意总是神秘莫测的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God works in mysterious ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他又三度来到我面前\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so it was, He introduced Himself again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.86,0:18:30.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一回的名字叫阿拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This time by the name of Allah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.08,0:18:47.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿拉 请保佑我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的阿拉伯语向来不好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My Arabic was never very good...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.71,0:18:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但祷词的音韵和感觉让我更靠近神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but the sound and feel of the words brought me closer to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:19:00.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在做礼拜时 我触碰的地面就成了圣地\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In performing Salah... the ground I touched became holy ground...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.26,0:19:03.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感到心境平和 信众一家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I found a feeling of serenity and brotherhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.44,0:19:05.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:16.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这羊肉味真好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This lamb is exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:18.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是全桌最好的一道菜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the best dish on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.24,0:19:20.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们都没口福\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're all missing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.41,0:19:25.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便辛 你只要再信三个教\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You only need to convert to three more religions, Piscine...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.75,0:19:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就能一辈子放假了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and you will spend your life on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.17,0:19:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今年要去麦加吗 耶稣大圣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you going to Mecca this year, Swami Jesus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是要去罗马受封 “便护 教宗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or to Rome for your coronation as Pope Pi-us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.92,0:19:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉维 你少起哄\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You stay out of this, Ravi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.64,0:19:40.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你爱打板球 派也有他的爱好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just as you like cricket, Pi has his own interests.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 吉塔 拉维说得有理\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Gita, Ravi has a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.81,0:19:47.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能同时有三个不同信仰\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You cannot follow three different religions at the same time, Piscine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.31,0:19:48.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.77,0:19:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because believing in everything at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.02,0:19:55.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同时什么都信就等于什么都不信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is the same as not believing in anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.86,0:19:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}桑陀旭 他还小\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's young, Santosh. He's still finding his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:59.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还在找方向
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.28,0:20:02.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不选定一条路怎么找方向\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And how can he find his way if he does not choose a path?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:08.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听我说 与其从一个教跳到另一个教\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, instead of leaping from one religion to the next...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:10.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}何不从理性出发\N{\rEN\blur0.8}why not start with reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.71,0:20:15.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}短短几百年内 科学带领我们了解的宇宙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In a few hundred years... science has taken us farther in understanding the universe...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就超过上万年历史的宗教\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than religion has in 10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.55,0:20:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那倒是 你爸爸说得对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is true. Your father is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}科学能教我们认识外在世界\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Science can teach us more about what is out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.68,0:20:28.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而非内在心灵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but not what is in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.14,0:20:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 有人吃荤 有人吃素\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some eat meat, some eat vegetable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.36,0:20:35.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们大家不可能观点都一致\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I do not expect us all to agree about everything...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.86,0:20:38.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我宁愿你相信我不认同的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I would much rather have you believe in something I don't agree with...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.70,0:20:41.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也不要盲目地接受一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than to accept everything blindly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:45.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先就是要理性思考\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And that begins with thinking rationally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你明白了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.08,0:20:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:00.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想要接受洗礼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would like to be baptized.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.06,0:21:09.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你既是基督徒又是回教徒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you're a Christian and a Muslim?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是印度教徒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a Hindu, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:12.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是犹太教徒吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a Jew, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我确实在大学教卡巴拉课\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I do teach a course on the Kabbalah at the university.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.69,0:21:18.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难道不行吗 信仰犹如一栋房子 有有许多房间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And why not? Faith is a house with many rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.53,0:21:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但却没有怀疑的空间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But no room for doubt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.03,0:21:22.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多了 每层都有好几间\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Plenty. On every floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.11,0:21:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怀疑作用巨大 它使信仰永葆活力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Doubt is useful. It keeps faith a living thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.91,0:21:29.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有经过考验 信仰才能显现力量\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After all, you cannot know the strength of your faith until it's been tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.46,0:21:36.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨方呢 他不在我们不该进来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Selvam? We shouldn't be in here without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.38,0:21:37.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.55,0:21:42.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看他喂食上千遍了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have seen him do this a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:47.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想看看新来的老虎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to meet our new tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:49.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.89,0:21:52.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello? Richard Parker?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.94,0:21:55.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老虎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A tiger? Richard Parker was a tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.81,0:21:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克是老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.11,0:21:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 秘书的笔误造就了它的名字\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, he got his name through a clerical error.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.11,0:22:02.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他小时候在溪边喝水被捉到的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A hunter caught him drinking from a stream when he was a cub...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:04.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被取名为口渴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and named him Thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:07.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}后来长到太大 卖给了我们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When Thirsty got too big, the hunter sold him to our Zoo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.41,0:22:10.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但文件上的名字写反了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but the names got switched on the paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.00,0:22:14.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}猎人写成口渴 老老虎写成理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The hunter was listed as Thirsty, and the tiger was called Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.42,0:22:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们笑坏了 名字也就沿用下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We laughed about it, and the name stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.00,0:22:20.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.26,0:22:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}免得惹上麻烦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before we get into trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.63,0:22:25.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想再近点看看它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to see him close up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.64,0:22:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又不是饲养员 走吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not a zookeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:29.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.45,0:22:49.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来 理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it, Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.78,0:22:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.98,0:23:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:25.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}住手 你想干什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是不是疯啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:29.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁允许你来这里的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who gave you permission to come back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.53,0:23:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把我的话都当耳旁风了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have just ignored everything I've ever taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.66,0:23:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想跟它打招呼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just wanted to say hello to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.71,0:23:38.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把老虎当朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think that tiger is your friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.67,0:23:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是动物 不是玩伴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's an animal, not a playmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动物也有灵魂 从眼神就看得出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Animals have souls. I have seen it in their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.72,0:23:51.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去叫萨方来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Find Selvam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:04.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老板你确定吗派只是个孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're sure, Sir? Pi's just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:06.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快点少废话\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do it. Go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:10.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动物跟人的想法不同\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Animals do not think like we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.70,0:24:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忘记这一点的人就会送命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}People who forget that get themselves killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.70,0:24:17.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那只老虎不是你的朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That tiger is not your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.04,0:24:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当你凝视它的眼睛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When you look into his eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.71,0:24:23.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到的只是反射回来的你自己的倒影\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you are seeing your own emotions reflected back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:25.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}仅此而已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.38,0:24:27.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别犯傻了 快道歉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be stupid. Say you're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.88,0:24:30.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便辛 你怎么回事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What have you done, Piscine?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.93,0:24:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸不让你来你还来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what your father said about coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.89,0:24:37.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 对不起 我只是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am sorry. I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.73,0:24:39.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要干什么啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.23,0:24:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我们父子之间的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is between a father and his sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.31,0:24:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨方 动作快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他都道歉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He said he's sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.48,0:24:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想让他们蒙上心理阴影吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to scar them for life?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.11,0:24:49.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阴影 你的宝贝儿子差点残疾了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Scar them? That boy almost lost his arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.24,0:24:50.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他还是个孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he's still a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.74,0:24:52.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他很快就会长大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He will be a man sooner than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.57,0:24:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要让他们永远记住今天的教训\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is a lesson I do not want them ever to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.33,0:24:57.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Selvam!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.08,0:25:45.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}据最新消息
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.84,0:25:48.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中央政府已经宣布国家处于紧急状态\N{\rEN\blur0.8}..and so has placed the country in a state of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.84,0:25:52.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}古吉拉特邦和坦米尔纳德邦 不再享有自治权利\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Under the directive, the states of Gujarat and Tamil Nadu...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.30,0:25:55.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将接受中央政府直接管辖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will be placed under the direct authority of the central government.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.51,0:25:59.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}政府授权警方逮捕并无限期拘留\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Police will be granted powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.39,0:26:01.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}任何发动暴动和企图发动暴动的公民\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to arrest and indefinitely detain citizens responsible for the uprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.64,0:26:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同时负责处理善后事宜
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.06,0:26:06.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走啊 下雨了 放学了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.06,0:26:09.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经过那场教训 一切都变了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Things changed after the day of Appa's lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.90,0:26:12.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世界不再那么有魅力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The world had lost some of its enchantment.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.16,0:26:16.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无聊的学校只会教自然 数学和法语\N{\rEN\blur0.8}School was a bore. Nothing but facts, fractions and French.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.37,0:26:21.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有没完没了的生字和句型\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Words and patterns that went on and on, without end.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.58,0:26:24.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我的无理数绰号\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like my irrational nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.50,0:26:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外地人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.00,0:26:34.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不安地寻找着能让生命恢复意义的事物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I grew restless searching for something that might bring meaning back into my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.43,0:26:38.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我认识了阿南蒂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then, I met Anandi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.06,0:26:48.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈逼我去学音乐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mother made me study music.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.02,0:26:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一天老师感冒了来不了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And one day, my teacher came down with the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.03,0:26:55.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我替他为一堂舞蹈课伴奏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He asked if I could take his place, playing rhythms for a dance class.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.88,0:27:13.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.59,0:27:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们要是不全神贯注 就无法以舞蹈敬神爱神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If you do not concentrate... you cannot express your love of God through dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.93,0:27:21.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感受自己脚踏实地的感觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Feel the ground beneath your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.22,0:27:23.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}双眼始终盯准地平线\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Open your gaze out onto the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.89,0:27:30.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让精神能量透过舞蹈 经由身体传递给世界 全神贯注\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let that spiritual energy pulse through you and out into the world. Through abhinaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.23,0:27:33.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}阿南蒂到前面来 领舞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anandi, come to the front. Lead them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.45,0:28:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么跟着我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.78,0:28:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.28,0:28:24.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你一直跟着我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were following me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.04,0:28:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个手势代表什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.50,0:28:33.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跳舞时先做了帕塔卡\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the dance, you went from pataka...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.80,0:28:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}代表森林\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which means the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.01,0:28:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接着是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then you did...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.18,0:28:39.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.01,0:28:41.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}山普塔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}samputa...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.51,0:28:44.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}代表隐藏起来的事物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which means something that is hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.35,0:28:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后你做了这个手势\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And after that, you did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.73,0:28:50.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}接着你做了恰图拉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then you did chatura.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.35,0:28:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过最后你做了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But at the very end, you did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.15,0:28:53.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个手势
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.90,0:28:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别的舞者都没做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}None of the other dancers did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.03,0:29:00.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是代表爱神藏在森林里吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you mean? The god of love is hiding in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.82,0:29:03.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是 这手势也代表莲花\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, that also means the lotus flower.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.20,0:29:06.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莲花藏在森林里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lotus flower is hiding in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.66,0:29:10.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莲花干嘛要藏在森林里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why would a lotus flower hide in the forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.34,0:29:20.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.01,0:29:24.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是园里有史以来最壮观的动物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is the most magnificent creature we've ever had here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.35,0:29:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看它转头的方式\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at the way he's turning his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.73,0:29:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}多爱表现\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Showing off. Like a dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.60,0:29:32.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟舞者一样
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不对 它听见什么了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, he heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.36,0:29:40.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它在用心听 懂吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's listening, you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.87,0:29:54.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们讨论好一阵子了 你听懂了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have talked about it for some time. Do you understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.38,0:29:55.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pi?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.96,0:29:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 你很……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry, you've been...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.88,0:30:02.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}担心这个家\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Worried. For my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.55,0:30:05.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的动物要是在外国可值大钱了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our animals are worth far more abroad than here in India.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.72,0:30:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是政府不给补助 我们根本经营不下去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And if the town council stops supporting us... I don't know where we will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.89,0:30:12.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以 这么做就毫无疑问了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, it is what we have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.23,0:30:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.23,0:30:19.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 我们在谈什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, what are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.82,0:30:21.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要离开印度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are leaving India.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.28,0:30:24.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.58,0:30:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要卖掉动物园\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are selling the zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.24,0:30:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卖也轮不到我们卖 地是政府的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The zoo was never ours to sell. The land belongs to the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.29,0:30:34.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但动物是我们的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But the animals are ours and if we sell them...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.75,0:30:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是卖掉 就有钱开始新生活\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we will have enough to start a new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.84,0:30:40.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我们去哪里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But where would we go? Our life is here, Appa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.88,0:30:40.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里就是我们的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.26,0:30:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加拿大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.42,0:30:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打听过过 温尼伯的工作比较好找\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have some opportunities for work in Winnipeg.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.26,0:30:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把大部分动物运到北美去卖\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be shipping most of the animals for sale in North America.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.43,0:30:49.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全家的船票我都已经买好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We can get freighter passage for the whole family.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.10,0:30:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以 都安排好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So... It is settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.52,0:30:56.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会像哥伦布一样远航\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will sail like Columbus.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.86,0:30:59.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但哥伦布当时是在找印度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But Columbus was looking for India.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:10.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卖动物园可是大工程\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It takes a lot of work to sell a zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.62,0:31:16.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在离开之前 阿南蒂和我有足够的时间来伤心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Before we left... Anandi and I had time enough to break each other's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.96,0:31:20.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然我保证总有一天会回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, I promised I would come back one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.17,0:31:22.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说也奇怪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.84,0:31:25.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后一天的事我全都记得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember everything else about our last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:29.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是不记得道别的部分\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I don't remember saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.65,0:31:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}派 快回去吃晚饭吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Pi? They're serving dinner below.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.33,0:31:58.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}便辛 你面前的是大好人生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Piscine... you have a whole life ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.42,0:32:02.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是为了你和拉维\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are doing this for you and Ravi.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.34,0:32:06.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进来吃点东西吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come inside and have some dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.89,0:32:17.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请给我素食\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Vegetarian, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.35,0:32:22.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们母子吃素 有没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My sons and I are vegetarians. Do you have anything--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.06,0:32:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no. Not more gravy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.61,0:32:24.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要淋肉汁
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.36,0:32:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不要肉汁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want gravy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.86,0:32:27.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.99,0:32:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要我要素食\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I want something vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.49,0:32:35.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.95,0:32:36.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.58,0:32:41.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是问你有没有素食\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She asked if you have something vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.71,0:32:46.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长这副肝的牛吃素\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cow that produced this liver was vegetarian,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.17,0:32:49.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这条腊肠里的猪也吃素\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the pigs that went into these sausages were vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.18,0:32:50.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很幽默\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.22,0:32:54.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是她不吃牛肝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But my wife doesn't eat liver.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.06,0:32:57.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的 没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.94,0:33:02.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那她就吃腊肠肉汁拌饭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Then she can eat the sausage, the rice, and the gravy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.98,0:33:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要么就自己做着吃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or you can cook your own food.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.32,0:33:07.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你竟敢对我老婆无礼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How dare you talk to my wife like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:10.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饭拿去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here's your rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.91,0:33:14.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是给水手做饭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I cook for sailors...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:15.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是给咖哩人做\N{\rEN\blur0.8}not curry-eaters.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.58,0:33:17.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:18.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放开我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.50,0:33:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当你是谁你只是个下人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who do you think you are? You're nothing but a servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.08,0:33:24.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喂人 你喂猴子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I feed people! You feed monkeys!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.43,0:33:36.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们好 我是随喜的佛教徒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello. I am happy Buddhist.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.97,0:33:40.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我吃浇肉汁的米饭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, I eat rice next to gravy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.94,0:33:44.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在船上 肉汁不算肉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}On ship, gravy is not meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.48,0:33:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}算味道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.36,0:33:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你试试\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You try?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.51,0:34:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.55,0:34:17.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在马尼拉靠岸后就会有新鲜的补给品\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will have plenty of fresh supplies after we stop in Manila.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.52,0:34:23.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么喂橙汁吃镇静剂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why give Orange Juice tranquilizers?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.31,0:34:26.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它又不会惹麻烦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's not going to cause any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.15,0:34:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长途旅行对动物非常不好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The stress of traveling is not good for the animals...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.53,0:34:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再说吃了药也不容易晕船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it helps with the seasickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.49,0:34:39.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可不想让猩猩晕船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't want to be cleaning up after a seasick orangutan...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:39.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}臭烘烘的吐一地
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.24,0:34:41.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.92,0:34:52.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸爸大小也算个老板 从没有亲自照料过动物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My father was a businessman. He had never tended the animals himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.38,0:34:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这时候我才明白其实我们离开印度 他比我还要痛苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I realized... leaving India must have been harder for him than it was for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.44,0:35:06.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.23,0:35:09.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有什么漏掉了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Have I forgotten anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.57,0:35:10.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把背景都介绍了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think you've set the stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.86,0:35:14.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个与法国泳池同名的印度男孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So far, we have an Indian boy named after a French swimming pool...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在一艘满载动物的驶向加拿大的船上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on a Japanese ship full of animals, heading to Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.87,0:35:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们得把男孩送到太平洋上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, we have to send our boy into the middle of the Pacific and--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.04,0:35:26.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后让我相信上帝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And make me believe in God.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.58,0:35:31.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊 会讲到那里的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. We'll get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.47,0:35:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从马尼拉出发后第四天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was four days out of Manila...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.89,0:35:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们到了马里亚纳海沟上 这里是地球上最深的地方\N{\rEN\blur0.8}above the Mariana Trench, the deepest spot on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.73,0:35:51.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们搭乘的奇桑号向前航行 对周围的一切视而不见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Our ship, The Tsimtsum, pushed on, bullishly indifferent to its surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.78,0:35:57.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它犹如一片大陆 缓慢而自信地移动着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It moved with the slow, massive confidence of a continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.61,0:36:34.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉维\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ravi?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.61,0:36:36.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉维你听见了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you hear that, Ravi?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.11,0:36:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在睡觉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.49,0:36:40.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有暴风雨 我们去看看吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a thunderstorm. Let's go watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.66,0:36:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯啦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.37,0:36:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们会被闪电劈到的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We will get hit by lightning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.45,0:36:47.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会的 闪电会先打到舰桥\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, we won't. It will hit the bridge first.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.79,0:36:51.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别跟老天过不去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't tempt a storm, Pi.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.11,0:37:58.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}雨再大点儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More rain! More rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.49,0:38:03.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}暴风雨之神啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lord of Storms!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.45,0:38:07.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}闪电啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.89,0:38:31.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船舱进水了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.06,0:38:33.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.14,0:38:34.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通知大家快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.56,0:38:36.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}进水了 大家快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.48,0:38:38.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.62,0:38:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Amma!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.41,0:38:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Appa!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.08,0:38:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉维\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ravi! Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.92,0:38:56.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.46,0:39:36.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.46,0:39:39.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来 船长 快走
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.67,0:39:41.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}到这里来 快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.63,0:39:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.80,0:39:44.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没时间了 到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.67,0:39:46.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快上救生艇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get in the boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.59,0:39:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}求求你 救救我的家人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please! Save my family!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.64,0:39:50.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别害怕 等着 别动\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't scare, okay? Wait, stay here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.76,0:39:52.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定要把他们救出来 求你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to help them! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.52,0:39:54.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}穿上 我解不开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Put this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.98,0:39:56.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我的家人 求你了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, my family! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.52,0:39:58.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没时间了 动作快点儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.73,0:40:00.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救救他们吧 没时间了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have to help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.15,0:40:02.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的家人还在里面 没时间了 快点儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-We don't have time.   -My family's back there!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.78,0:40:05.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们去救 你快走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We help! You must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.19,0:40:06.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁把动物都放出来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who let all the animals out?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.53,0:40:07.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你快走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.95,0:40:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 我要去救我爸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, wait, my father! He can't swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.53,0:40:11.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不会游泳 快走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.87,0:40:14.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓好 抓好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.29,0:40:17.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓住船 小心啊 抓住\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hang on to the boat! Hold, hold!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.00,0:40:18.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓好 就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.50,0:40:21.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把船放下来 放下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bring it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.96,0:40:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.50,0:40:25.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心 抓住绳子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.55,0:40:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在可以把这个船放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.01,0:40:31.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说你呢 你要干什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! You! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.01,0:40:32.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抓好 放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.64,0:40:33.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跳\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.06,0:40:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.06,0:40:38.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斑马
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.85,0:40:40.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要跳下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.69,0:40:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快跳
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.66,0:40:59.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}救生艇被冲走了 那小伙子还在上面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.04,0:41:43.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在这里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Over here! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.12,0:42:19.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richard Parker?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.00,0:42:21.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.58,0:42:25.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要 走开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! Go away! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.90,0:44:15.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.84,0:44:37.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Amma!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.88,0:44:41.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Appa! Ravi.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.43,0:44:41.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉维
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.93,0:44:46.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.44,0:44:51.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.21,0:46:36.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哈里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hari?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.79,0:47:14.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来镇静剂的药效还没退\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Looks as though your drugs haven't worn off yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.06,0:47:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}橙汁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Orange Juice! Orange Juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.14,0:47:33.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}橙汁
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.24,0:47:49.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎登上派的方舟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to Pi's Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.27,0:48:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}橙汁 你儿子呢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is your boy, Orange Juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.53,0:48:30.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry, I bet mother and father found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.57,0:48:30.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸妈一定找到它了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.33,0:48:36.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们很快就会来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They'll all be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.76,0:48:47.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.34,0:48:53.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.06,0:48:58.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有没有人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.29,0:50:02.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.96,0:50:07.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要这样 够了 不要 不要这样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it! No! Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.97,0:50:15.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.01,0:50:14.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.14,0:50:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.02,0:51:02.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 橙汁\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Orange Juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.73,0:51:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有晕船药给你吃\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have any seasickness medicine for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.02,0:51:10.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}补给品\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Supplies. Supplies!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.98,0:51:09.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有补给品
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.70,0:51:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海上求生手册
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.41,0:51:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饮水须知 不得饮用海水
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.55,0:52:20.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.06,0:52:31.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.48,0:52:32.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.07,0:52:34.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.76,0:52:57.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.42,0:52:57.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.92,0:52:59.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.79,0:57:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫派 帕帖尔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My name is Pi Patel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.71,0:57:47.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我遭遇了海难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have been in a shipwreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.88,0:57:50.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}独自在救生船上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}! amon a lifeboat alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.80,0:57:54.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一只老虎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.06,0:57:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请派人救援\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please send help.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.46,0:59:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上帝啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, I give myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.75,0:59:49.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把自己交给你
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.42,0:59:52.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我心无旁鹜\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am your vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.67,0:59:58.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无论未来如何\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever comes, I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.51,0:59:57.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都想知道
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.51,1:00:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请给我指点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.40,1:00:10.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世界洋流
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.86,1:00:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看不出来流向啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are no lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.78,1:00:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将物品整理好 准备打一场生存保卫战\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Set your house in order and dig in for the battle to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.37,1:00:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}订下一周的饮食 观察与休息时间表\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Establish a strict schedule for eating, keeping watch and getting rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.04,1:00:32.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}切勿饮用尿液和海水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not drink urine or sea water.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.21,1:00:38.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自己找事干 但要注意保持体力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep busy but avoid unnecessary exertion.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.05,1:00:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为防止寂寞无聊 可以打牌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The mind can be kept occupied by playing card games...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.22,1:00:47.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玩问答或猜谜游戏\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Twenty Questions, or I Spy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.90,1:00:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家一起唱歌也能够振奋精神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Community singing is another surefire way to lift the spirits.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.78,1:00:59.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}讲故事也是不错的选择\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Telling stories is highly recommended.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.91,1:01:06.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最重要的是不要绝望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Above all, don't lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.76,1:01:19.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晕船最容易使人的意志消沉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Few things can sap the spirit faster than seasickness.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.59,1:01:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船身侧对浪头 风浪会显得特别大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Waves are most strongly felt when a boat turns sideways to the current.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.35,1:01:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}伞锚如浮锚 可让船保持顶风\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A sea anchor is used as a drag to keep the boat's head to the wind.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.14,1:01:35.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正确使用可增加稳定性 降低大风浪的不适感\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Proper use of them can increase control and reduce seasickness during rough seas.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.94,1:01:41.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}必须与大型食肉动物同船者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For castaways who must share their lifeboats with large, dangerous carnivores...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.28,1:01:44.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}建议你一定要划定自己的地盘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}it's advisable to establish a territory as your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.83,1:01:46.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尝试下列方法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Try this method.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.33,1:01:47.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.66,1:01:50.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}选择风浪适中而规律的一天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Choose a day when waves are moderate, but regular.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:54.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step two. With the lifeboat facing into the waves...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.29,1:01:58.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让救生船顶风 使船上尽可能舒适 然后轻吹哨子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}making the ride as comfortable as possible, blow your whistle soothingly.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.13,1:02:02.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第三步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step three. Turn the lifeboat sideways to the waves...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.47,1:02:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将船身侧对风浪
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.64,1:02:05.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同时吹起刺耳挑畔的哨音\N{\rEN\blur0.8}accompanied by harsh, aggressive use of the whistle.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.01,1:02:07.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重复这些步骤\N{\rEN\blur0.8}With sufficient repetition...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.81,1:02:12.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}动物一听到哨音 就会联想到晕船不适\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the animal will associate the sound of the whistle... with the discomfort of seasickness.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.23,1:02:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尽管训练师不会来到大海上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Similar methods have long been used by circus trainers...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.57,1:02:19.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但此法在马戏团中广泛应用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}though they generally lack access to rough seas.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.03,1:02:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吹响号角吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let the trumpets blare!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.99,1:02:26.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}擂起响鼓吧 我们开始吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let the drum rolls begin!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.33,1:02:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备大开眼界吧\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Prepare to be amazed!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.33,1:02:34.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敬请大家欣赏指教\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here it is, for your enjoyment and instruction!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.17,1:02:39.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}您期待了-一辈子的精彩奇幻秀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The show you've been waiting for all your life...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.67,1:02:42.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即将拉开惟幕\N{\rEN\blur0.8}will soon begin!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.22,1:02:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好见证奇迹了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you ready for the miracle of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.43,1:02:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么为各位隆重介绍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then, I give to you...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.35,1:02:55.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}令人惊叹震撼的孟加拉虎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the astounding Bengal tiger!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.53,1:03:10.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克你好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hello, Richard Parker. Sorry about the choppy ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.91,1:03:09.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉船这么颠
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.40,1:03:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的地盘 你懂吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mine! You understand? Yours, mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.07,1:03:48.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的 我的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.45,1:03:54.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你懂了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.51,1:04:08.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第四步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Step four.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.26,1:04:11.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就当前三步没发生\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Disregard steps one through three.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.54,1:04:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来 理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, Richard Parker. I got some water for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.04,1:04:43.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}过来喝点水吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.81,1:05:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}园里平均每天给老虎喂5公斤的肉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In the zoo, we fed our tigers an average of five kilos of meat a day.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.90,1:05:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以理查德 帕克很快就会饿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richard Parker will be getting hungry soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.07,1:05:11.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老虎是游泳健将 若让它饿到一定程度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tigers are powerful swimmers, and if he gets hungry enough...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.66,1:05:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怕那一小片海面就保护不了我了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm afraid the little bit of water between us won't be any protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.04,1:05:18.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得设法喂饱它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need to find a way to feed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.71,1:05:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以吃饼干 但上帝让老虎吃肉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can eat the biscuits but God made tigers carnivores...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.34,1:05:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我得学着捕鱼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so /! must learn to catch fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.67,1:05:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要不然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}lf I don't, I'm afraid his last meal will be a skinny, vegetarian boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.00,1:05:29.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它的最后一餐肯定是个吃素的瘦小伙
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.52,1:05:41.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耐心点儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Patience!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.04,1:06:46.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.86,1:07:49.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在干什么啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.54,1:08:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别急 我再想想\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait! I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.01,1:09:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}32盒饼干\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thirty-two cartons of biscuits.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.76,1:09:47.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}93罐饮用水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ninety-three cans of water.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.55,1:11:01.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.80,1:11:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.72,1:11:10.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你 毗湿奴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Lord Vishnu.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.48,1:11:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你化身为鱼 救了我们的命\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you for coming in the form of a fish and saving our lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.90,1:11:17.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.03,1:13:29.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我把饼干和水都搬到木筏上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course, I brought all the biscuits and water
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.49,1:13:31.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以免被理查德吃掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on the raft with me to keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.07,1:13:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真蠢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.54,1:13:41.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}饥饿能把人彻底改变 即使你想得再好也没用\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hunger can change everything you ever thought you knew about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.59,1:14:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拿去 给你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Here, it's yours!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.70,1:15:43.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它是我的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.69,1:16:53.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能总回船上拿补给 风险太大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't risk my life every time I have to climb onto the boat for supplies.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.86,1:16:56.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该解决这个问题了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's time to settle this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.28,1:17:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要一起生活 就得学会沟通\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If we're going to live together, we have to learn to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.87,1:17:06.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许理查德 帕克无法被驯服\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe Richard Parker can't be tamed, but with God's will, he can be trained.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.83,1:17:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但天意让它可以被训练
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.32,1:18:17.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不行\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.94,1:18:20.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回去
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.99,1:18:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.70,1:19:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去啊 理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go, Richard Parker. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.87,1:19:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.24,1:19:52.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回窝里去 我就不惹你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go on home, I'll leave you alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.08,1:19:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证会尊重你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll respect that, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.21,1:20:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去啊 快点儿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.06,1:20:12.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好耶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.92,1:20:51.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想不到一小片凉荫就能让我无比愉悦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I never thought a small piece of shade could bring me so much happiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.35,1:20:57.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一堆工具 一个桶 一把刀 一支笔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That a pile of tools, a bucket, a knife, a pencil...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.44,1:20:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都成了我的宝贝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}might become my greatest treasures.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.81,1:21:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克的陪伴让我心情平静\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or that knowing Richard Parker was here might ever bring me peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.82,1:21:06.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在这种时候\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In times like these...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.44,1:21:11.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会令我想到我们同样缺乏现实体验\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I remember that he has as little experience with the real world as I do.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.49,1:21:14.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都在动物园由同一个主人养大\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We were both raised in a zoo by the same master.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.00,1:21:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在都成了孤儿 一同面对那至尊的主\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we've been orphaned, left to face our ultimate master together.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.12,1:21:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有理查德 帕克 我早就活不了了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Without Richard Parker, I would have died by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.84,1:21:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对它的恐惧令我警醒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My fear of him keeps me alert.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.34,1:21:29.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}满足它的需求 给我生活目标\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tending to his needs gives my life purpose.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.64,1:21:36.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是海豚\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Dolphins.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.23,1:21:38.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克 走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Richard Parker!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.66,1:21:57.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.42,1:22:53.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最重要的是 不要绝望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Above all, don't lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.41,1:23:25.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}1 9 4 0 0 9 10
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.46,1:23:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}8 5 5 366\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Eight, five, five, zero, three, Six, Six...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.76,1:23:32.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}0 8 0 1\N{\rEN\blur0.8}zero, eight, zero, one...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.47,1:23:37.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}360 4668\N{\rEN\blur0.8}three, six, zero, four, six, six, eight...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.10,1:23:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在看什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.28,1:23:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我说说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.66,1:23:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我你看见什么了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me what you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.74,1:26:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}语言文字是我仅剩的救命索\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Words are all I have left to hang on to.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.67,1:26:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都变得混乱 破碎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Everything mixed up. Fragmented.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.59,1:26:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已无法分辨白日梦 睡梦与现实\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't tell daydreams, night dreams, from reality anymo--...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.94,1:26:39.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克 有暴风雨\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Storm, Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.47,1:27:08.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.19,1:27:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.21,1:27:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赞美神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Praise be to God!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.09,1:27:45.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全天下之主\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lord of all worlds!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.22,1:27:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那悲天悯人 慈慈悲为怀的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The compassionate, the merciful!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.19,1:27:57.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.19,1:28:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克 你一定要出来看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richard Parker! Come out, you have to see this!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.86,1:28:05.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太美了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.88,1:28:21.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要躲起来 神显灵了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't hide yourself! He's come to us!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.21,1:28:23.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是神迹\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.48,1:28:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克快出来拜见神\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come out and see God, Richard Parker!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.83,1:28:56.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么吓它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you scaring him?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.21,1:28:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}神啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.42,1:29:02.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我失去了家人 我失去了一切\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've lost my family! I've lost everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.25,1:29:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我臣服 你还想要什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I surrender! What more do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.99,1:29:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry, Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.06,1:32:42.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要死了 理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're dying, Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.64,1:32:49.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.18,1:33:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Amma, Appa, Ravi...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.02,1:33:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸 拉维
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.77,1:33:31.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真高兴我就快见到你们了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm happy I'm going to see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.36,1:33:42.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你感受到雨水了吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you feel the rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.51,1:34:06.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}神啊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}God, thank you for giving me my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.76,1:34:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感谢你赐予我生命
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.56,1:34:10.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我准备好了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm ready now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.59,1:34:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richard Parker?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.03,1:36:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}借过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.90,1:36:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.36,1:36:29.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开 借过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Move. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.12,1:38:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.34,1:38:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.84,1:38:55.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让开 这是我的床\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, get away. This is my bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:03.47,1:41:05.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是人的牙齿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a human tooth?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.06,1:41:09.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还不懂吗 那是一座食人岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you see? The island was carnivorous.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.31,1:41:12.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}食人岛 就像捕蝇草\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Carnivorous? Like a Venus Flytrap?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.32,1:41:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 整座岛都是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, the whole island.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.32,1:41:19.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}植物 水塘里的水 整片大地\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The plants, the water in those pools, the very ground itself.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.49,1:41:23.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}白天那些水塘里是淡水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}During the day, those pools held fresh water.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.62,1:41:28.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然而夜里 某种化学作用让淡水变成酸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But at night, some chemical process turned the water in those pools into acid...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.79,1:41:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}酸溶解了那些鱼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}acid that dissolved those fish...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.17,1:41:34.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以狐蒙躲到树上去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that sent the meerkats scurrying into the trees,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.55,1:41:36.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克跑回船上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Richard Parker running to the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.13,1:41:39.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但牙齿是哪来的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But where did the tooth come from?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.30,1:41:42.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}许多年前 有人跟我一样不幸\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Years ago, some poor fellow, just like me...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.26,1:41:45.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发现自己来到那座岛上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}must have found himself stranded on that island...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.18,1:41:48.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也想干脆永远留下算了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and, like me, thought he might stay there forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.69,1:41:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是岛在白天赏赐他的美好 在夜里又全部收走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But all that the island gave him by day, it took away again by night.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.03,1:42:00.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想想他有多少时光 只有狐獴为伴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To think, how many hours spent with only meerkats for company.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.36,1:42:02.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}承受了多少寂寞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How much loneliness taken on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.16,1:42:07.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只知道他最后死了 岛消化了他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All I know is that eventually he died and the island digested him...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.62,1:42:10.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只留下他的牙齿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}leaving behind only his teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.71,1:42:15.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看出留在那里的下场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw how my life would end if I stayed on that island.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.34,1:42:17.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是孤独被人遗忘\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Alone and forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.88,1:42:22.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得重返人世 就算死也要试\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had to get back to the world, or die trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.39,1:42:29.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二天我开始进行准备\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I spent the next day preparing the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.35,1:42:31.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}储存了满满的淡水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I filled my stores with fresh water...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.60,1:42:34.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}海草都吃到了嗓子眼\N{\rEN\blur0.8}ate seaweed until my stomach could take no more...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.40,1:42:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为理查德 帕克在储藏柜里塞满狐蒙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and brought as many meerkats as I could fit into the storage locker for Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.07,1:42:45.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然不能扔下它 那样等于杀了它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't leave without him, of course. It would mean killing him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:46.91,1:42:49.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是我等它回来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so, I waited for his return.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.00,1:42:53.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道它不会迟到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I knew he wouldn't be late.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.08,1:42:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richard Parker!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.93,1:43:12.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再也没有人见过那座浮岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one has seen that floating island since.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.60,1:43:15.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自然类书籍上也查不到那种树\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you won't read about those trees in any nature book.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.06,1:43:20.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然而要是不曾靠岸 我早就死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And yet, if I hadn't found those shores, I would have died.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.28,1:43:25.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要是没发现那颗牙齿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I hadn't discovered that tooth, I would have been lost, alone forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.74,1:43:25.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经独自人间蒸发
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.95,1:43:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使看似离弃我时 神也在持续观望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even when God seemed to have abandoned me... He was watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.29,1:43:34.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使看似不关心我受罪 神也在持续观望\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even when He seemed indifferent to my suffering... He was watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.88,1:43:38.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当救助无望时\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And when I was beyond all hope of saving, He gave me rest...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.75,1:43:38.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他让我休息
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.88,1:43:41.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后指示我继续我的旅程\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then gave me a sign to continue my journey.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.81,1:44:00.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们抵达墨西哥海岸时 我根本不敢放开船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}By the time we reached the Mexican shore, I was afraid to let go of the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.78,1:44:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我早已筋疲力竭 虚弱不堪\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My strength was gone. I was so weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.32,1:44:10.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}虽然水深只有两英尺 即将得到解救的我却怕被淹死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was afraid that in two feet of water, so close to deliverance... I would drown.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.59,1:44:23.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后我挣扎上岸 直接倒在沙滩上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I struggled to shore and fell upon the sand.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.76,1:44:28.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}沙滩温热柔软 就像紧贴着上帝的脸颊\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was warm and soft... like pressing my face against the cheek of God.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.85,1:44:34.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在某处有一双眼睛笑咪咪地欢迎我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And somewhere, two eyes were smiling at having me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.36,1:44:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我筋疲力尽 几乎动弹不得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was so spent, I could hardly move.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.12,1:44:51.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是理查德 帕克先走一步\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so, Richard Parker went ahead of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.66,1:44:56.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它伸展四肢 走在海岸上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He stretched his legs and walked along the shore.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.13,1:45:03.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来到丛林边缘 它停了下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At the edge of the jungle, he stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.88,1:45:06.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认定它会回头看我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was certain he was going to look back at me...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.63,1:45:09.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耳朵往后垂 发出咆哮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}flatten his ears to his head, growl.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.89,1:45:13.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它应会以某种形式结束我们的关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That he would bring our relationship to an end in some way.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.89,1:45:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但它只是盯着丛林里看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he just stared ahead into the jungle.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.65,1:45:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then, Richard Parker, my fierce companion...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.86,1:45:28.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我凶猛的同伴 让我活下来的恐怖家伙\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the terrible one who kept me alive...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.87,1:45:34.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从此在我的生命中永远地消失了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}disappeared forever from my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.50,1:45:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几小时后 我的同胞发现了我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After a few hours, a member of my own species found me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.50,1:45:47.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他带回一群人来把我抬走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He left and returned with a group who carried me away.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.76,1:45:52.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哭得像个孩子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wept like a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.22,1:45:56.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是因为高兴获救 虽然我很高兴\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not because I was overwhelmed at having survived, although I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.43,1:46:03.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我哭是因为理查德 帕克离开了我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was weeping because Richard Parker left me so unceremoniously.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.06,1:46:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么轻易地离开了我
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.07,1:46:07.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的心都碎了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It broke my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.08,1:46:15.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爸说得没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, my father was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.12,1:46:18.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理查德 帕克根本没拿我当朋友\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Richard Parker never saw me as his friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:19.46,1:46:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一起历尽艰辛 它却头也不回\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After all we had been through, he didn't even look back.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.54,1:46:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我必须相信在它眼中\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I have to believe there was more in his eyes...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.59,1:46:29.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看到的不只是我自己的倒影\N{\rEN\blur0.8}than my own reflection staring back at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:29.76,1:46:32.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的知道 感受得到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know it. I felt it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.93,1:46:35.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即便我无法证明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Even if I can't prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.44,1:46:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我失去了好多事物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I've left so much behind.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.10,1:46:45.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的家人 动物园 印度 阿南蒂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My family, the zoo, India, Anandi.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.82,1:46:49.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜人生到头来就是不断放下\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I suppose, in the end, the whole of life becomes an act of letting go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.65,1:46:53.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但永远最令人痛心的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But what always hurts the most...
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.66,1:46:57.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是没有好好地道别\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is not taking a moment to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.00,1:47:03.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没能感谢我爸教我那么多事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was never able to thank my father for all I learned from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.33,1:47:06.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并且告诉他 没有他的教导\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To tell him, without his lessons...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.92,1:47:09.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我绝对活不下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I would never have survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.30,1:47:14.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道理查德 帕克是老虎 但我真希望我说了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know Richard Parker is a tiger, but I wish I had said...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:15.14,1:47:17.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都结束了 我们活下来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"It's over. We survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.97,1:47:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你救我一命 我爱你 理查德 帕克\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Thank you for saving my life. I love you, Richard Parker.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.94,1:47:24.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你我会永远在一起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"You will always be with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.19,1:47:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿上帝与你同在\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"May God be with you."
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.70,1:47:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道该说什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.29,1:47:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信是不是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's hard to believe, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:49.96,1:47:52.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要吸收的有很多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is a lot to take in.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.55,1:47:55.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也要思索其中的意义\N{\rEN\blur0.8}To figure out what it all means.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.39,1:47:59.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生就发生了 为什么要有意义\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If it happened, it happened. Why should it have to mean anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.85,1:48:03.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些部分很不可思议\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Some of it is pretty incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.98,1:48:06.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}由于我是唯一的生还者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, I was the only one who survived the shipwreck.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.90,1:48:10.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}日本船运公司派了两个人找到了我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So the Japanese shipping company sent two men to talk to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.23,1:48:13.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当时我在墨西哥的医院休养\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in the Mexican hospital where I was recovering.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.16,1:48:17.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}报告副本我还留着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I still have a copy of their report.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:19.24,1:48:22.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们要处理保险理赔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They had insurance claims to settle...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.50,1:48:25.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以想查明沉船原因\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they wanted to find out why the ship sank.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.42,1:48:27.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们听了也不信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They didn't believe me, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.04,1:48:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保险报告1978年2月19日
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.13,1:48:35.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一座浮岛上有成千上万只狐\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thousands of meerkats on a floating carnivorous island...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.01,1:48:36.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却没有人见过\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and no one has ever seen it?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.09,1:48:39.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, just like I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.47,1:48:39.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我说的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.97,1:48:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}香蕉不会浮起来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Bananas don''t float.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.89,1:48:43.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你提香蕉干什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why are you talking about bananas?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.43,1:48:46.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说猩猩坐在香蕉堆上漂向你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said the orangutan floated to you on a bundle of bananas.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.44,1:48:48.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是香蕉不会浮\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But bananas don't float.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.31,1:48:49.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.94,1:48:52.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然会浮 你自己试试看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course they do. Try it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:53.40,1:48:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之我们不是来问香蕉或狐朦的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In any case, we are not here to talk about bananas or meerkats.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.66,1:49:01.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚才说了这么长时间 我很累了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I've just told you a long story and I'm very tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.12,1:49:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们来是因为有日籍货船在太平洋沉没\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We are here because a Japanese cargo ship sank in the Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.29,1:49:08.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远忘不了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Something I never forget.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.92,1:49:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我失去了全家人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I lost my whole family.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.05,1:49:18.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给他倒杯水\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get him some water.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.22,1:49:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不是要逼你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't mean to push you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.56,1:49:27.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也很同情你的遭遇\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you have our deepest sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.60,1:49:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们大老远来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But we have come a long way...
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.77,1:49:32.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}却没有调查出沉船的真相\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and we are no closer to understanding why the ship sank.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.98,1:49:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我不知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.36,1:49:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在睡梦中被吵醒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was asleep. Something woke me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.11,1:49:39.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许是爆炸 我不确定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It could have been an explosion, I can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.82,1:49:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后船就沉了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then the ship sank.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.28,1:49:43.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们还要我说什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What else do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:44.08,1:49:46.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回去这么说 肯定会被人看成是傻子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A story that won't make us look like fools.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.54,1:49:49.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}写报告需要单纯确切的说法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need a simpler story for our report.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.75,1:49:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让公司可以看得懂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}One our company can understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.17,1:49:54.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家也都能相信\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A story we can all believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.51,1:50:00.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以不要没有见过的事物\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, a story without things you've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:01.01,1:50:02.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常正确\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.51,1:50:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要有惊奇 不要有动物和岛\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Without surprises. Without animals or islands.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.85,1:50:09.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 只要真相\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. The truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.03,1:50:20.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你怎么做的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.04,1:50:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我讲了另一个故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I told them another story.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.20,1:50:29.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有四个人生还\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Four of us survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.25,1:50:32.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子和水手已经先上了船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cook and the sailor were already aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.08,1:50:35.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子用救生圈把我拉上船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cook threw me a lifebuoy and pulled me aboard...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.09,1:50:38.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妈妈爬上一堆香蕉 漂到了船上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Mother held on to some bananas and made it to the lifeboat.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.22,1:50:43.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个厨子很恶心\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cook was a disgusting man.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.39,1:50:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他吃了一只老鼠\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He ate a rat.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.76,1:50:49.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}储存的粮食够吃好几周 但他逮到一只老鼠 就杀了它\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We had food enough for weeks, but he found the rat in the first few days...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:49.06,1:50:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}晒干然后吃掉\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and he killed it, dried it in the sun and ate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.90,1:50:55.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个人就像野兽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was such a brute, that man.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.90,1:50:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过他并非一无是处\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he was resourceful.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.94,1:51:03.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}提议搭木筏钓鱼的就是他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was his idea to build the raft to catch fish.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.74,1:51:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有他 我们头几天就死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We would have died in those first few days without him.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.25,1:51:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水手就是那个拿肉汁拌饭给我的佛教徒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The sailor was the same man who brought rice and gravy, the Buddhist.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.92,1:51:17.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们语言不太通 只只知道他很痛苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We didn't understand much of what he said, only that he was suffering.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.75,1:51:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他跳船时把腿摔断了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He had broken his leg horribly in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.09,1:51:23.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们尽量帮他接直 但伤口感染了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We tried to set it as best we could, but the leg became infected...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.59,1:51:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子说再不截肢 他就会死\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and the cook said that we had to do something or he'd die.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.60,1:51:32.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子自告奋勇 但妈妈和我得按住他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cook said he'd do it, but Mother and I had to hold the man down.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.19,1:51:34.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也相信这是万不得已\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I believed him, we needed to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.36,1:51:37.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}于是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:38.94,1:51:42.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一直说对不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I kept saying, "I'm sorry, I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,1:51:42.20,1:51:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他只是一直看着我 眼眼神好……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he just kept looking at me. His eyes were So...
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.20,1:51:52.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我永远不会明白人为什么要受那么多苦\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll never understand the point of that man's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.83,1:51:56.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我忘不了他的惨叫\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can still hear him.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.71,1:52:00.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随喜的佛教徒 他只吃肉汁拌饭\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The happy Buddhist, he only ate rice and gravy.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.68,1:52:07.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们当然没救活他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We didn't save him, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:07.89,1:52:09.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他死了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He died.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.39,1:52:12.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二天早上 厨子钓到第一只鬼头刀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The morning after, the cook caught his first dorado...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:12.64,1:52:15.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我起初不知道他做了什么\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I didn't understand what he had done at first, but Mother did...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.31,1:52:18.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妈妈知道 我从没见过我妈那么生气\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I had never seen Mother so angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.65,1:52:21.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他说别抱怨 开开心点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Stop whining and be happy," he said.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.74,1:52:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}食物不多一点我们就会死 这才是重点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"We need more food or we'll die. That was the whole point."
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.74,1:52:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我妈妈问他什么重点\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"What was the whole point?" Mother asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.82,1:52:30.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把那孩子杀了就为了当鱼饵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"You let that poor boy die in order to get bait, you monster!"
Dialogue: 0,1:52:32.41,1:52:33.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子火大了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cook got furious.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.66,1:52:35.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他挥起拳头想打我妈妈\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He started towards her with his fist raised...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.83,1:52:38.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}结果却被我妈妈狠狠地赏了一巴掌\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Mother slapped him hard, right across the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.04,1:52:40.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我愣住了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was stunned.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.09,1:52:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为他会当场杀了她\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought he was going to kill her right then.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.88,1:52:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然而他没有\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.68,1:52:51.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子的目的可不只是鱼饵\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cook didn't stop at bait either, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:52.60,1:52:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个水手\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The sailor...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.94,1:52:58.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他的下场跟老鼠一样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He went the same way the rat went.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.02,1:53:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子毫不浪费\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The cook was a resourceful man.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.70,1:53:09.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个星期后他……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was a week later that he...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.58,1:53:13.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都是我的缘故\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.91,1:53:16.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我放跑了一只乌龟\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I couldn't hold on to a stupid turtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.42,1:53:19.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它从我手上滑掉游走了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It slipped out of my hands and swam away.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.08,1:53:22.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}厨子冲上来就我的头\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the cook came up and he punched me on the side of my head...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.59,1:53:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打得我牙齿相撞 眼冒金星\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and my teeth clacked and I saw stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.96,1:53:28.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为他还要揍我 但我妈拼命他\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought he was going to hit me again... but Mother started pounding on him with her fists...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.05,1:53:30.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大喊禽兽 禽兽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}screaming, "Monster, monster!"
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.39,1:53:32.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她叫我上木筏去 快上去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She yelled at me to go to the raft.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.76,1:53:36.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为她会跟来 否则\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought she was coming with me, or I'd never have...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.48,1:53:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我为什么没叫她先走\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't Know why I didn't make her go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.11,1:53:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每天都回想这事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think about that every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.49,1:53:56.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我跳过去一回头就见到厨子拔刀\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I jumped over and turned back just as the knife came out.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.08,1:54:02.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全无法阻止\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There wasn't anything I could do.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:04.42,1:54:06.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又无法不去看\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't look away.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.64,1:54:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把她的尸体扔下船\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He threw her body overboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.76,1:54:18.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后鲨鱼群来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then the sharks came. And I saw what they...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.14,1:54:18.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见它们……
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.32,1:54:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看见\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.03,1:54:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第二天 我把他杀了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The next day, I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.78,1:54:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没有还手 他知道他太过分了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He didn't even fight back. He knew he had gone too far...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.79,1:54:39.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}连他自己都过意不去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}even by his own standards.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.83,1:54:46.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他把刀放在椅子上 我做了他对水手做的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He'd left the knife out on the bench, and I did to him what he did to the sailor.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.38,1:54:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个很坏的人 更更糟的是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was such an evil man, but worse still, he...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.55,1:54:57.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他激发出我内心的邪恶\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He brought the evil out in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.81,1:55:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一点我必须承受\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I have to live with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.90,1:55:10.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一个人在救生船上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I was alone in a lifeboat...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.53,1:55:14.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}漂过了太平洋\N{\rEN\blur0.8}drifting across the Pacific Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.08,1:55:16.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我活了下来\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I survived.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.04,1:55:25.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}之后他们就没再发问了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After that, they had no more questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.50,1:55:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们似乎并不满意这个说法\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The investigators didn't seem to like the story, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.01,1:55:34.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但他们十分感谢我 又祝福我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But they thanked me, they wished me well, and they left.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:33.51,1:55:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后就走了
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.18,1:55:43.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这两个故事里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So the stories...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:46.02,1:55:50.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}斑马和水手都摔断腿\N{\rEN\blur0.8}both the zebra and the sailor... broke their leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.19,1:55:54.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬣狗咬死斑马和猩猩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And the hyena killed the zebra and the orangutan.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.86,1:55:58.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So... the hyena is the cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.03,1:55:58.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}鬣狗是厨子
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.20,1:56:01.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}水手是斑马\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The sailor is the zebra.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.87,1:56:04.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你妈妈等于是猩猩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Your mother is the orangutan.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:04.92,1:56:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而你就是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you are...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.88,1:56:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老虎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the tiger.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.30,1:56:17.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以问一件事吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.60,1:56:20.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然可以\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.60,1:56:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于这个海上事故 我说了两个故事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've told you two stories about what happened out on the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.60,1:56:27.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两个都无法说明沉船原因\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Neither explains what caused the sinking of the ship...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.06,1:56:32.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也没有人能证明故事是真是假\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and no one can prove which story is true and which is not.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.40,1:56:35.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在两个故事里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}In both stories, the ship sinks...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.24,1:56:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}船都沉了
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.91,1:56:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的家人都死了 我受尽磨难\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my family dies and I suffer.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.28,1:56:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没错\N{\rEN\blur0.8}True.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.29,1:56:45.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么你更喜欢哪一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, which story do you prefer?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.09,1:56:55.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有老虎的那一个\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The one with the tiger.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.26,1:56:58.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个比较精彩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the better story.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.85,1:57:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.18,1:57:06.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你跟随上帝\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so it goes with God.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.32,1:57:20.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈纪说的对\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mamaji was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.16,1:57:23.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这故事真了不起\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's an amazing story.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:24.87,1:57:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的要让我写吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Will you really let me write it?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:26.96,1:57:28.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.54,1:57:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不就是妈妈纪叫你来的原因吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't that why Mamaji sent you here, after all?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.80,1:57:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太太回来了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My wife is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.55,1:57:39.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}要留下来吃吗 她手艺很不错的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you want to stay for dinner? She's an incredible cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.80,1:57:41.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你有妻子\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know you had a wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.14,1:57:43.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一只猫和两个小孩\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a cat and two children.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.97,1:57:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你的故事结局很圆满\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, your story does have a happy ending.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.81,1:57:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 这点由你决定\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:49.81,1:57:52.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}故事是你的了\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The story is yours now.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.54,1:58:13.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个惊险的故事 充满勇气与毅力\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Mr. Patel's is an astounding story of courage and endurance...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.38,1:58:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以毫不夸张地说 在海难史上独一无二\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"unparalleled in the history of shipwrecks.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.05,1:58:21.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能在海上活这么久的生还者不多\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Very few castaways can claim to have survived so long at sea...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:21.51,1:58:24.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}陪伴他的不是人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"and none in the company...
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.22,1:58:26.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是一只孟加拉虎\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"of an adult Bengal tiger."
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.60,1:58:30.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.02,1:58:33.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有客人来 我帮你们介绍\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a guest. Let me introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:34.61,1:58:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好 你好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi.   -Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.57,1:58:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很高兴认识你 很高兴认识你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.36,1:58:39.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是阿蒂塔 你好阿蒂塔\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adita.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.70,1:58:40.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是拉维\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ravi.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:46.43,2:06:47.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中国电影集团公司 进 口
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.52,2:06:48.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中国电影股份有限公司 译 制
Dialogue: 0,2:06:48.56,2:06:49.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}中国电影股份有限公司 华夏电影发行有限责任公司 联合发行
